     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[Comment from Sourceforge Task]",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "Comment Submitter: cwilper",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "SCOPE REDUCTION:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "This task does not require content model validation as part of the error description.  A follow-on task (see original feature request for reference) will do this.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "REVIEW NOTES:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "I verified the following behavior when manually testing this branch:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "a) When BMech is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which BMech is missing.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "b) When CModel is missing, the dissemination fails with a 404 and a note indicating which CModel is missing.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "c) When a bound datastream is missing, the dissemination fails with a 500 and a n unfriendly stack trace[1].",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Case (c) still needs to be handled (it should respond with a 404 and a message indicating which datastream(s) were missing) before closing this task out.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "[1] fedora.server.errors.GeneralException: Error getting ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.dissemination.DisseminationService.get(DisseminationService.java:961)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.dissemination.DisseminationService.getDisseminationContent(DisseminationService.java:991)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.dissemination.DisseminationService.assembleDissemination(DisseminationService.java:637)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.DefaultAccess.getDissemination(DefaultAccess.java:419)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.FedoraAccessServlet.getDissemination(FedoraAccessServlet.java:707)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "at fedora.server.access.FedoraAccessServlet.doGet(FedoraAccessServlet.java:449)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
